  "description": "Calculate the total projection area of 3D shapes formed by 1x1x1 cubes in an n x n grid.",
  "pseudocode": "1: xy = 0, yz = 0, zx = 0\n2: for r in 0..n-1:\n3:   maxR = 0, maxC = 0\n4:   for c in 0..n-1:\n5:     if grid[r][c] > 0: xy++\n6:     maxR = max(maxR, grid[r][c])\n7:     maxC = max(maxC, grid[c][r])\n8:   yz += maxR\n9:   zx += maxC\n10: return xy + yz + zx",
